Portions of the scheduling logic (stripboard timeline cascade, conflict and
schedule-lock scanning, strip color palette, date-range shifting, CineSched
project import) are derived from CineSched 5.0, GPL-3.0:
  - CineSched, original app by Christopher Tempel
    https://github.com/ChrisTempel/CineSched
  - Stripboard, calendar, banners and PDF exports by alucardGonza
    https://github.com/alucardGonza/CineSched_D.G.D

Screenplay element rules (Tab/Enter flow, import classifier), shot list fields
and option lists are based on the free tools by Inwood Park Productions:
"Don't Pay For Screenwriting Software", "Don't Pay For Storyboarding Software"
and "Shot List for Free" — https://github.com/InwoodParkProductions

Ideas for shot blocking (top-down floor plans where each camera is a shot) and
the gear manifest were inspired by Open Shot Designer by koosoli, GPL-3.0 —
https://github.com/koosoli/OpenShotDesigner (no code was copied). Support its
developer: https://github.com/sponsors/koosoli · https://buymeacoffee.com/koosoli

